{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴西總統大選周日（25日）舉行第二輪投票決選，現任總統、勞工黨候選人盧拉與前總統博索納羅之子、自由黨候選人弗拉維奧（Flávio Bolsonaro）的競選團隊周二先後表示，向高等選舉法院申請撤銷對方參選資格。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T14:01:51.090586+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:15:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:17:43.117215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:57:53.695820+00:00","content_hash":"5c90132f7ed9b389053400b605de05bc563fe4bc99f8f63db9a18d61d95dd54a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}